ether if I buy a bundle order?","text":"<p>The grill and accessories will be sent in separate packages and might not arrive at the same time.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_JDEbNU":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"I received the wrong item! What do I do?","text":"<p>Mistakes happen and we apologize! Contact us via Email (<a href=\"mailto:CustomerService@Monumentgrills.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:CustomerService@Monumentgrills.com\">CustomerService@Monumentgrills.com<\/a>) or Chat and we will create a return for the incorrect item. Once that item has been successfully dropped off or picked up by the carrier your replacement No charge order will be created and a new Order number with tracking information will be emailed to you.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_mYRfhC":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How to install my Denali grill?","text":"<p>We include a user manual in the package of each product with detailed assembly instructions. You can also watch our assembly video. <\/p><p>The link: <a href=\"https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/pages\/assembly-manuals-and-videos\" title=\"https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/pages\/assembly-manuals-and-videos\">https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/pages\/assembly-manuals-and-videos<\/a><\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_bj67kc":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Why is Denali's warming rack constructed differently than regular ones? ","text":"<p>Denali's warming rack is a multifunctional design capable of holding chicken thighs, chicken legs, roast peppers, and much more, offering greater versatility compared to ordinary cooking grids.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_XKqxxp":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Where can I see the temperature?","text":"<p>You can check the temperature via Bluetooth app or Smart Temperature Display.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_rwX6FD":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Is the Bluetooth stable to use? ","text":"<p>Yes, the Bluetooth connection with the grill is reliable for up to 65 feet outside.<\/p>","read_number":0}}},"block_order":["category_YbEL79","question_8rmJnJ","question_VVrGd6","question_HdTpHB","question_PbBJKM","question_JDEbNU","question_mYRfhC","question_bj67kc","question_XKqxxp","question_rwX6FD"],"settings":{"heading":"FAQs on Denali 605 Pro","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"none","full_width":true}},"1709290372794ca6d9":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"yotpo_product_reviews_ugc_reviews_hWrkzb":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/reviews\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["yotpo_product_reviews_ugc_reviews_hWrkzb"],"settings":{"link_id":"","full_width":false}}},"order":["main","rich_text_GPJtyQ","image_banner_fzj3Wf","icons_with_text_cc9MeK","details","video_zFzw4c","rich_text_Xf3eFm","video_VbKHn3","rich_text_ehENVx","use_image_banner_gBfYLq","multi_column_aALANz","rich_text_fzETKh","video_antPQz","multi_column_jkea4R","rich_text_Y6aXdq","media_grid_iphpNJ","parts_dot_HjncrA","media_with_text_33nNqM","product_comparison_grid_P3476i","recommendations","video_Uzjt9f","icons_with_text_QLrYtw","faq_tcPUPr","1709290372794ca6d9"]}